      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When everything feels like a performance, the most honest thing you can do is stop performing for anyone. That cage you feel is built by the rules you've accepted, and you have the power to dismantle them, even if it feels impossible right now. Think about what would happen if you just let go of the need to be \"good\" or \"successful\" for a single day. Sometimes, the only way out is to stop fighting the walls and just let them crumble.",
